The network code in Sources/NERVEMLX/NERVE.swift is derived from nerve_arch.py in that repository.

The files Sources/NERVEMLX/Resources/*-mlx.safetensors are the five released NERVE checkpoints
(4x_NERVE_OTF_fidelity, 4x_NERVE_release, 2x_NERVE_release, 4x_NERVE_OTF_gan, 2x_NERVE_OTF_gan),
Copyright Philip Hofmann, Apache License 2.0, re-laid out from PyTorch (O, I, kH, kW) to MLX
(O, kH, kW, I) convolution weights with no change of value; the sha256 of each source file is
recorded in its safetensors metadata.

Per the upstream model card, the released weights were trained only on the CC0-1.0 dataset
Phips/lucid-cc0-v2-hc-512 (derived from Phips/lucid-cc0-v2, tiled from nyuuzyou/pxhere, a re-host of
images published under pxhere.com's platform-wide CC0 licence).
